  "changelog": "Initial release of office-web-slide: a browser-based HTML slide generator\n\n- Generates interactive web slides (HTML) based on user-provided content and style preferences.\n- Features a parallel \"three-bucket\" workflow guiding users to supply content, structure, and visual style.\n- Offers 16 preset modern themes (8 styles \u00d7 light/dark), advanced layouts, charts, and entrance animations.\n- Strictly prevents metadata, user profiles, and sources from leaking into slide content.\n- Includes a complete workflow: theme selection (visual picker), template-based HTML assembly, comprehensive visual QA, and split output for large slide decks.\n- Supports data visualization (SVG, Chart.js, ECharts), localized theme customization, and component-based extension.",
